do GameState.start_minigame()
[background arg="res://assets/Minigame/Minigame_1.png" fade="1.0" transition="Push Up"]
audio music "res://audio/higheruniversalman-take-me-out-to-the-ball-game-sports-stadium-crowd-music-506221.mp3" [volume="-14.0" loop="true"]
join Dagger center
set {strikes_number} += 1.0
[wait time="1.5"]
label Journal Select
do MenuManager.open_journal()
[wait_input]
if {is_success} == true:
	do MinegameTest.update_background("strikes_number")
	if {current_item} == "d_brother_death":
		Lizzy: you told me last loop that your first vampire kill was your older brother.
		Dagger: Oh.
		Dagger: that is not something I ever wished to share with you, Elizabeth.
		Lizzy: You were in a pretty bad place.
		Dagger: My brother wasn't a good person, but he did not deserve his fate.
		Dagger: I atone for that mistake everyday—
		Lizzy: Yeah, you've told me all this already.
		Dagger: oh, yes.
		Dagger: right.

	elif {current_item} == "d_zombie_plan":
		Lizzy: For the last few loops Lady MacDeath keeps attacking the town with zombies.
		Lizzy: it's really annoying.
		Dagger: her plan... how could you possibly know that. I haven't told you yet.
		Lizzy: She's doing it because she's really broken up about me killing her husband.
		Lizzy: Like really broken up.
		Dagger: Yes.
		Dagger: She loved King Fear a great deal.
		Dagger: Even despite the troubles.
		Dagger: It’s driven her to behave in strange ways.
		Lizzy: Uh, she seems the same sort of crazy as she was before?
		Dagger: She isn't so bad once you get to know her.
		Dagger: She can be quite lovely at times.
		Dagger: Shakespeare was her husbands thing. She hates that bard.
		Dagger: I think that eventually she will come into her own, but for now, she's using it as a crutch to deal with her negative emotions.
		Lizzy: You've really analysed her, huh?
		Dagger: I spend a lot of time alone with my thoughts.
		Dagger: And she tends to voice everything out loud,
		Dagger: so there’s lots of to go off.

	set {strikes_number} += 1.0
	join Item leftmost [animation="Zoom In" length="9.0"]
	leave Item [animation="Slide To Right" length="1.1" wait="true"]
	if {strikes_number} == 1.0:
		[background arg="res://assets/Minigame/Minigame_2.png" fade="0.0" transition="Simple Fade"]
	elif {strikes_number} == 2.0:
		[background arg="res://assets/Minigame/Minigame_3.png" fade="0.0" transition="Simple Fade"]
	elif {strikes_number} == 3.0:
		[background arg="res://assets/Minigame/Minigame_4.png" fade="0.0" transition="Simple Fade"]
	[wait time="1.5"]
else:
	Dagger: I do not understand...
	Lizzy: Uh, yeah,
	Lizzy: it's important you stay curious.
	Dagger: indeed...
set {is_success} = false
if {strikes_number} < 3.0:
	jump Journal Select
[background fade="2.0" wait="true"]
audio music - [fade="4.0"]
Dagger: It doesn’t make any sense.
Lizzy: Like it or not, she's added trapping me in an endless time loop to her ultimate revenge plan, so that's great.
Dagger: I don't know why she wouldn't have talked to me about it first. She always consults with me.
Lizzy: Maybe she knows about...
Lizzy: You know, the conflict of interest?
do GameState.end_minigame()
jump ending_5/